# wgq: the wgq label namespace belongs to dom0 alone.
#
# Labels are created and removed through the Admin API, and the qrexec
# argument of those calls IS the label name -- so these rules pin wgq's
# own labels by name. The API's default is already deny for every VM;
# what these lines add is permanence: sorted at 30, they keep matching
# first even if a management qube is someday granted broad
# admin.label.* powers by a later-sorted allow. dom0 itself is not
# subject to policy, which is the point -- only actions taken in dom0
# can shape wgq's identity.
admin.label.Create +wgq * @adminvm deny notify=yes
admin.label.Remove +wgq * @adminvm deny notify=yes
admin.label.Create +wgq-fw * @adminvm deny notify=yes
admin.label.Remove +wgq-fw * @adminvm deny notify=yes
admin.label.Create +wgq-mgmt * @adminvm deny notify=yes
admin.label.Remove +wgq-mgmt * @adminvm deny notify=yes
admin.label.Create +wgq-tpl * @adminvm deny notify=yes
admin.label.Remove +wgq-tpl * @adminvm deny notify=yes
